#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:2 78a8410184fc4b028659ed163cda731b
msgid "✨ Segment Anything v1 (CUSTOM)"
msgstr "✨ 分段任何内容 v1（自定义）"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:5 58b51a35fc074d43b9e7d5f357703864
msgid ""
"This model has been deprecated as default one and moved to custom. it's "
"available only by request."
msgstr "此模型已被弃用作为默认模型并移至自定义模型。它只能根据要求提供。"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:7 f868cee71aec417a84bb07f19617b7c2
msgid ""
"The “Segment Anything” (originaly introduced by Meta as *universal "
"segmentation model*) is available as yet another experimental model in "
"Mapflow. We adjusted it to Mapflow workflows to be used on a scale. There "
"are the same steps required to launch this model:"
msgstr ""
"“Segment Anything”（最初由 Meta 作为 *通用分割模型* 引入）可作为 Mapflow 中的另一个实验模型。我们将其调整为 "
"Mapflow 工作流程，以便大规模使用。启动此模型需要执行相同的步骤："

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:9 cb7edc0b11364c28b86b19054c0a3362
msgid "Select your data source"
msgstr "选择您的数据源"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:10 03761c13c4bb48da9c0b0e199f998613
msgid ""
"Select your geographical area - either polygon, GeoJSON file, or your image "
"extent"
msgstr "选择您的地理区域 - 多边形、GeoJSON 文件或图像范围"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:12 a149f9c487624d87814f8e8594e3de49
msgid "Yet there is one difference in the model workflow:"
msgstr "然而模型工作流程有一个区别："

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:14 156a0bc4e02c40839410608835a18948
msgid ""
"if you run this model using GTIFF file — the original resolution of the "
"image will be used"
msgstr "如果您使用 GTIFF 文件运行此模型 — 将使用图像的原始分辨率"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:15 318708d28b9a47e3b05462179a628b9f
msgid ""
"if you run it via TMS (e.g. :ref:`Imagery` like Mapbox Satellite) — you need"
" to select the Zoom level (image resolution) from the model options which "
"will be used for the input"
msgstr ""
"如果您通过 TMS 运行它（例如 :ref:`Imagery` 像 Mapbox "
"Satellite） — 您需要从模型选项中选择用于输入的缩放级别（图像分辨率）"

