msgstr "例如。结果 – SAM（缩放 16）"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:63 cb9036b2bbf04a8e88aa87e5fab7ad73
msgid "E.g. Result – SAM (zoom 18)"
msgstr "例如。结果 – SAM（缩放 18）"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:72 401ffa32832b453b9324f2456e32ebb6
msgid ""
"E.g. Result – SAM on aerial imagery (zoom 20), single trees. Some polygons "
"are not very accurate and some target objects are missing, but the overall "
"result is relevant and can be used for more accurate mapping."
msgstr ""
"例如。结果 – 航空图像上的 SAM（变焦 20），单棵树。有些多边形不是很准确，有些目标对象丢失，但总体结果是相关的，可以用于更准确的映射。"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:80 9bd6ad95ec684ef1a788b45c2402adb6
msgid ""
"E.g. Result – SAM on  aerial imagery (zoom 20), containers. Applicable to "
"small similar-pattern objects, requires some manual filtering of the model's"
" output."
msgstr "例如。结果 – 航空图像（变焦 20）、集装箱上的 SAM。适用于小型相似图案对象，需要对模型的输出进行一些手动过滤。"

#: ../userguides/sam_model.rst:83 7a8cc7ad9d104ef785d758b71ae4276d
msgid ""
"❗️ SAM is not provided in :doc:`Mapfow for QGIS <../../api/qgis_mapflow>` "
"list of default models, as the zoom options are not enabled in the current "
"plugin’s design. Yet if you work in QGIS and want to try SAM there — send us"
" a request and we will connect corresponding workflow scenarios with all "
"zoom options specified."
msgstr ""
"❗️ :doc:`Mapfow for QGIS <../../api/qgis_mapflow>` 默认模型列表中未提供 "
"SAM，因为当前插件的设计中未启用缩放选项。然而，如果您在 QGIS 工作并想在那里尝试 SAM — "
"向我们发送请求，我们将使用指定的所有缩放选项连接相应的工作流程场景。"
